<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 100,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 100,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's est receipts 100,000, Wk ago 110,000, and Yr ago 114,000 head.</p>
<p>Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs.</p>
<p>Barrows and gilts traded steady to $0.50 higher than the mid-session Friday. Trade was slow to moderate for moderate to good demand and light to moderate offerings.</p>
